window.products.push({"id":171135,"name":"KOOV Jumbo Soup Mug, Soup Bowls with Handles Microwave Safe, Ceramic Soup Mugs with Handles, Jumbo Mug Set of 4, 24 Ounce (Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518HePg-GzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【LARGE CAPACITY WITH GREAT SHAPE】: 24 Ounce jumbo mug can meet all of your need for serving different kinds of food. This cup of soup is Deep and large enough to use for cereal, oatmeal, soup, nuts, salad, fruit, rice and noodle without spillage. 【STRIPED PATTERN】: The KOOV soup mugs with handles feature unique striped pattern for enjoyable dining time. Remarkable display can be a charming decoration even an artwork in your dining table and kitchen. 【LARGE INSULATED HANDLE】: The huge user-friendly handle is comfortable to grip. Perfect size, large handle, unique appearance make these mugs ideal for family use. 【HEALTHY AND DURABLE PORCELAIN】: Unlike other materials, ceramic mugs has no harmful plastics, cadmium or Lead. Never worry about harmful substance leaching into your food. Sturdy enough and chip-resistant will ensure years of use. 【DISHWASHER SAFE AND EASY CLEANUP】: These soup cups can be used in the oven, microwave, refrigerator and dishwasher. Smooth glaze resists sticking, easy to clean with dishwasher or even hand wash with soap and water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518HePg-GzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOOV","source_asin":"B08P7BXX1D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7BXX1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7BXX1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":171136,"name":"Gritt Commercial pH Increaser | pH up | Swimming Pool, Spa and Hot Tub Chemicals | Raise pH Levels | Soda Ash | Natural 100% Pure Sodium Carbonate Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CmWioPasL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"pH INCREASER FOR POOL AND SPA: Maintaining proper pH balance is key to ensuring healthy pool and spa water. On the pH scale of 0-14, pools and spas should be between 7.2-7.6, ideally 7.4. If the pH balance fluctuates too low, you'll experience reduced effectiveness of chlorine, corrosive water, etching in the interior, and irritated skin and eyes. The first step towards better pool and spa health is the Gritt Commercial pH increaser. SAFE FORMULA: Our granulated pH increaser is mess-free, unlike liquid pH-increasing chemicals, and uses ZERO harsh chemicals. It’s made with 100% naturally found soda ash (sodium carbonate). It’s safe to use for both pool and spa, and works on all sanitizing systems. SAFE FORMULA: Our granulated pH increaser is mess-free, unlike liquid pH-increasing chemicals, and uses ZERO harsh chemicals. It’s made with 100% naturally found soda ash (sodium carbonate). It’s safe to use for both pool and spa, and works on all sanitizing systems. Easy to use: Simply measure out the suggested amount (1 lb per 10,000 gallons of water), mix it with at least 1 gallon of water in a chemical-safe container, and pour it around the perimeter of the pool or spa. Repeat as needed until pH is in the desired range. Our mineral quickly dissolves into your pool and stabilizes it and other pool chemicals, preventing skin and eye irritation. ZERO SIDE EFFECTS: Raise the pH levels of your pools, spas, and even hot tubs without stressing about any side effects. Our pool pH increaser uses ZERO harsh chemicals and is made safely in the USA. We bring convenience back to standard maintenance and safely re-balance your waters with proven results of Sodium Carbonate powder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CmWioPasL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRITT COMMERCIAL","source_asin":"B09YV75W87","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YV75W87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YV75W87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
