window.products.push({"id":171208,"name":"GOFLAME Fireplace TV stand for TV up to 55 Inches, Freestanding Wood Entertainment Center with 18” Electric Fireplace, 48\" TV Console Table with 2 Ope","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RFoNcRE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: This fireplace TV stand combining both heating and storage function will be the perfect choice for you! The spacious tabletop, 2 open storage compartments and 2-door cabinets with 3-position adjustable middle shelves offer extra storage space for multiple items like albums, decoration, stereo and books. Besides, the entertainment console table with 2 cable manage holes fit for TVs up to 55”. Moreover, the electric fireplace with 4777 BTU heat output can heat up to 400 square feet. And you can control the fireplace heater by adjusting the touch panel or remote as needed. This electric fireplace with mantel can accompany you all seasons with separate flame effects. More importantly, the overheat protection and CSA certification ensure safe use. Features: Heat up to 400 square feet with 4777 BTU heat output3-level flame brightness to meet your different needsBuilt-in thermostat(62°F - 82°F) and 0.5-6 hours timer function for energy-savingSafe to use with overheat protection and CSA certificationThe flame effect can run independently for all year round useBring great convenience with the dual control designLarge tabletop and 2 open storage compartments for capacious storage spaceKeep the cords neat and tidy with 2 cable management holes Specifications: Color: White/ Black/ NaturalMaterial: MDF, Engineered Wood, Tempered Glass, Steel, Plasticverall Dimension of TV Stand: 48\" x 16\" x 30\" (L x W x H)Overall Dimension of Electric Fireplace: 19\" x 5\" x 17.5\" (L x W x H)Length of Power Cable: 6 ftTotal Net Weight: 84 lbsWeight Capacity of Tabletop: 70 lbsWeight Capacity of Each Open Storage Compartment: 20 lbsWeight Capacity of Each Middle Shelf in the Door: 20 lbsWeight Capacity of Each Bottom Shelf in the Door: 20 lbsPower Rating: 1400WVoltage: 120VFrequency: 60HzHeat Output: 4777 BTUHeating Area: 400 Sq. FtEffective Control Distance of Remote Control: 20 ftPackage Includes:1 x TV Stand1 x Electric Fireplace1 x Remote Control1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RFoNcRE8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOFLAME","source_asin":"B0BLLTV839","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLLTV839","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLLTV839","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":171209,"name":"Gold Ornate Frame Edged Neutral II by Chris Paschke, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618BvVL7g3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features gold and grey abstracted flower designs. Chris Paschke's comfort with the Sumi brush and continuing study with Asian masters have brought her 'lovingly into the world of passive, peaceful Zen concepts, and the simplicity of an Asian artist.' the minimalism she brings to wild Apple in her soft grasses, floral, characters and handmade papers continues to flourish with new visions, colors and textural studies. Many trips to China have fueled her desire to learn more about the art form, and have LED her to create a living environment in the mountains of central California. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618BvVL7g3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0776DVTQJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0776DVTQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0776DVTQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
