window.products.push({"id":171302,"name":"Luksyol Clay pot for cooking - Handmade tagine pot moroccan for cooking - Lead free earthenware pot - Embossed Pattern Tagine Pot Oven Safe - 100% Nat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noKIECrWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in Europe - These clay cooking pots are Handmade crafted from natural unglazed terracotta & Lead Free So they are Safe to use & eco-friendly. Easy to clean - The clay pot for cooking can be cleaned easily with water and baking soda. The handmade cookware (clay pot cooking) needs to be seasoned. Healthy Option - Each terra cotta pot has a conical top with a Height of 8.5 in and base of 11.42 in. The ideal heat distribution of the terra cotta pots keeps the nutritional value of the food as It takes less time on the fire, The Pottery retains the texture of vegetables and works to prevent them from being mashed. Safe to Use - The terracotta tagine clay pot improves your digestion naturally as the clay pots for cooking retain the pH value of acidic water & foods, The steam is free from All Toxins. Multipurpose - The tagine pot moroccan for cooking is Safe to use in Refrigerator, Microwave, Stove & Oven up to 500 degrees F, Start using your moroccan tagine pot at low temperature then slowly raise the heat. Secured - We Pack the terracotta pot in Polyfoam Packaging for extra Protection during Shipping. Multiple Sizes - These large terracotta pots Come with with Traditional & Elegant design that can be used as a serving bowl for a variety of authentic cuisines which are Indian, Turkish, Spanish and Mexican recipes. Luksyol Clay cooking pots need to be seasoned before use. Soaked in water for 6 hours minimum. Left to dry for 1 hour. Rubbed with oil (olive or any frying oil). Placed in a cold oven and turned the heat on to 350 F / 175 C for 2 hours and left to get cold. Rubbed with oil again. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Use the heat diffuser. The most important thing is the Moroccan tagine pot (clay pot for cooking) is not prepared to be high-fired, only from low fire. Each cooking pot has a conical top that measures a Height of 7.9\" and a base of 11.42. Each tagine clay pot for cooking can be used for a variety of foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noKIECrWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luksyol","source_asin":"B0B9XRDVBP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XRDVBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XRDVBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
