window.products.push({"id":171367,"name":"California Design Den Luxury 100% Cotton Sateen Buttery Soft 800 Thread Count Bed Sheet Set, Beats Fake Egyptian Claim, Durable Deep Pocket Fitted She","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716B4pxZ6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RESTFUL REJUVENATION: Awaken in luxury and comfort with our 800 thread count 100% cotton king size bed sheets. Certified for high thread count, they offer a buttery soft, smooth and crisp feel like five-star hotel beds. The sateen sheen gives a lustrous finish, ensuring cool and comfortable sleep all year long. SHEET SET WITH A GREAT FIT: Our 4-piece 100% cotton sheets set includes 1 top sheet (112\"W x 102\"L), 1 bottom fitted sheet (78\"W x 80\"L) that fits mattresses 8 to 16 inches deep, and 2 king size pillowcases (21\"W x 40\"L). The special anti-skid & wide elastic won't loosen or bunch up, and head/foot side indicators make bed-making a breeze. INDEPENDENLTY TESTED & AUTHENTIC: You will appreciate the high level of comfort and softness these high thread count sheets provide being a true 800 thread per square inch of fabric. Many sellers make exaggerated unverifiable claims of Egyptian cotton sheets, but we don’t. Our 100% cotton sheet set is made using the finest cotton grown in India and loved by customers for its high quality. EASY TO WASH & LASTS FOR YEARS: You can machine wash and dry our natural cotton sheets at regular settings, and they'll come out looking great. Our sheets are very durable, and won't pill, fade, or shrink. Our sheets are certified “Oekotex Standard 100”, tested for harmful substances to protect your health. OUR COMMITMENT: We strive to do our part. In 2022, we donated over 14,000 pieces of bedding to local charities in the USA. We do not use plastic in our packaging. Made in our family-owned & operated factory in India, each piece is inspected for quality, and we promise to replace any defective products at no cost to you. Buy with confidence with our 30-day return policy, even if you've washed or used our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716B4pxZ6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B09P51VL9Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P51VL9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P51VL9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
