window.products.push({"id":171459,"name":"4PCS Bed Sheet Holder Straps Fasteners, Triangle Mattress Sheet Clips with Heavy Duty Suspenders and Adjustable Bed Bands to Keep Sheets from Sliding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AGkGVU3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Sheets in Place: Put an end to messy beds and start waking up every morning to smooth bedsheets! We offer the best solution to our customers. Easy to attach: No need to lift heavy mattresses! We provide an easy 3-step solution: (1) Grab the corners of your fitted sheets, (2) clip the sheets, (3) put them back on the corners of your mattress …and you’re done! Premium Quality: To provide customers with the best experience, we have selected the best raw materials with the trendiest designs. Stainless steel clips prevent moisture and rust from accumulating while extending the life of the product. The gripper’s plastic circular gear design stops the sheets from slipping. Latex add-in bands make the fabric more elastic and durable. Make great gifts and have multiple purposes: Our fancy packaging makes them the perfect present for moms, dads, grandmas, grandpas, friends, and neighbors on special occasions such as Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, birthdays, housewarming parties, and baby showers. Bedsheet holder straps can be used on bunk beds, waterbed mattress pads, air mattresses, camper beds, RVs, baby cribs, boats, sofas, motorcycle seat covers, cushion, cars, tables, etc. One-month trial, lifetime service: Our one-month trial program guarantees 100% satisfaction. If the product does not meet your expectations, we will refund your money in full. No questions asked. Order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AGkGVU3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supar","source_asin":"B089GGFYFQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GGFYFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GGFYFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
