window.products.push({"id":171463,"name":"Zak Designs Planeterra Icicle & Rosewater 18 oz Set of 2 Reusable Straw Water Bottle with Built-In Handle for Travel, Made with Durable Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ie6h7vS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Planeterra: Grounded in the Future To keep our planet looking beautiful for years to come, we can't let our landfills continue to expand. That's where the Planeterra line comes in: made with revolutionary plastic material, it breaks down toxin-free in 3 to 5 years in traditional landfill environments, leaving behind only gases and trace amounts of water and biomass. And as easy as it is to return to the earth, this eco-friendly plastic still has a long lifespan. With no loss of durability or shelf life, you can use and reuse Planeterra products as part of your daily routine--it's a small change that can make a big impact towards leaving the planet in good shape for future generations. Terra Straw Water Bottle The water bottle is lightweight and has a carry handle that makes it easy to take on the go, along with a spout that flips down out of the way when it's not being used. It fits in car cup holders, and won't leak when the spout is closed. The set includes two 18-ounce water bottles with different colors to make hydration an easy part of your daily routine.Set contains 2 water bottles. 18 oz capacity. Cold water recommended. Made of durable, reusable plastic. BPA free - committed to safety. Dishwasher safe, do not microwave. Dimensions: Length: 4.17 in, Width 2.93 in, Height: 7.15 in. Color: Icicle and Rosewater.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ie6h7vS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B08W4XN9JY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-171463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W4XN9JY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W4XN9JY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
