window.products.push({"id":171673,"name":"Lavinya Premium Extra Large Turkish Hand Towel 20x36 Inches - Super Absorbent, Quick Dry and Lightweight 100% Cotton Bathroom Hand Towels- Ultra Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxK-BmgZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are your hands getting the pampering they deserve? Your hands are one of the most hardworking and useful parts of your body. You use these hand towel for cleaning, doing chores, and working on your goals. And like the skin on your face, the skin of your hands is sensitive and require delicate care. Yet unlike the face, they seldom get the attention they need. After a long hard day of work, imagine how invigorating it is to wash, clean and dry your hands in the pampering softness of cotton Turkish towels. Give your hands a break and treat them with our deluxe hand towels. Enjoy luxurious hand towels comparable to those from 5-star resorts and spas with the Ozdilek Small Hand Towels! Discover the difference of genuine Turkish cotton hand towels in comfort, quality, and overall drying experience. Made of 100% Turkish cotton, our towel for bathroom are highly absorbent and soft to touch. Turkish cotton fabric has a beautiful texture and a quick-dry characteristic that makes it ideal for spas and guest bathrooms. You don't have to worry about the unpleasant odors as these towels stay fresh for longer than regular cotton ones. A double-stitched hem and tightly woven materials enhance the towel's durability and quality. Each one is machine washable and dries quickly to save energy and water. And the best part? It only gets softer and fluffier with continued use and washes. Here are more reasons to enhance your bathroom or kitchen with these hand towels: ✅ Available in plain, chic colors and elegant patterns ✅ Makes a fantastic and practical gift for weddings, housewarmings, and Christmas ✅ Beautiful designs, can also be used in restaurants, hotels, or spas Give your skin a treat with lush towels fit for a king or queen. Add our the Ozdilek Hand Towels to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxK-BmgZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAVINYA","source_asin":"B098DNQL98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-171673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098DNQL98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098DNQL98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":171674,"name":"Wilkblck Dream Catcher Pink Feathers Dream Catcher with Love Heart Pendant, Girly Heart Room Decor, Dream Catcher Handmade Creative Home Ornament Craf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZmsJ2bM1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature* The dream catcher originated in the 18th century and is something that every Indian family has.* The Indians believe that the air of the night is full of floating dreams and the wisdom left by the ancestors,both good and bad. Dream catcher filters it, so that only a beautiful dream can enter our dreamland. * There is a round hole in the middle of the net.It is said that only a good dream can pass through the hole and flow down the feathers,and the nightmare will be trapped in the net. In the next morning,the sun shone in the early morning,and the nightmare disappeared without leaving a trace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZmsJ2bM1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09LRYTQTB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-171674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRYTQTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRYTQTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
